lzj/thumb/5/53/tlx2k2s6xqvztf63zwnu7ssxnv4nv6z.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%8D%E7%9A%84%E9%BC%93%E8%88%9E.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/53/tlx2k2s6xqvztf63zwnu7ssxnv4nv6z.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%8D%E7%9A%84%E9%BC%93%E8%88%9E.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/53/tlx2k2s6xqvztf63zwnu7ssxnv4nv6z.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />与你同在\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协攻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">协攻</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协防\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">协防</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合。目标是&lt;伊利亚&gt;阵营时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协攻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">协攻</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协防\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">协防</font></span></span>]计算友军数量时额外加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ae/hp9k0iltoe2iq8n6u80ny5dwrlv7l6n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/ae/hp9k0iltoe2iq8n6u80ny5dwrlv7l6n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%9B%E5%89%91%E7%9B%BE%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/王国军剑盾兵\"><img alt=\"头像 王国军剑盾兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/02/7gpnzfvbspx6lr0hl35uc2h8qmuiip8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">王国军剑盾兵</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8D%97%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伊南娜\"><img alt=\"头像 伊南娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b5/9hm20wqmn7ph2gcqx5l6cy0zgizkd3m.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-